    "about": { "x": 0, "y": 2168, "w": 390, "text": "The top row walks one real scan: scene 5c0c5ba7, Sonnet 5, 22 items in 2:46 for $0.165. The brain does not stream yet. So the item times are modeled from that scan's token counts: about 88 s of reading and search, then one item every 3.4 s. Main plays the whole flow at 4x. The speed is a tweak. The Timeout board stretches every time by 1.3 to reach the 3:00 limit. The eBay stats on the eBay board come from the test fixture, not a real eBay call." }
